Every table leaves on purpose, and schema.sql makes nothing but drops them:
an empty database, which opens again with nothing to do.

== before
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;
CREATE INDEX dish_name ON dish (name);
INSERT INTO dish VALUES (1, 'soup');

== after
-- @drop table dish

== plan
